# Scenario expect-load-refusal (plan 04-20, D-20): outcome pass, exit 0. The same truncated
# cartridge as unexpected-refusal, but the scenario expects the refusal, so it ends as pass.
# expect-detail: load-refused-as-expected role=cart status=IVS_E_MALFORMED reason=1
ivss 1
id expect-load-refusal
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1-truncated.ivsc
expect-load cart IVS_E_MALFORMED
run-to 4000 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
